# {{.Name}}

Your own program in the Breadboard lab `{{.Experiment}}`. `bb add app` wrote a minimal Go program here and added it to `experiment.yaml`. Nothing in it is a lesson or fake business logic: it wires up each used service's official client from the environment variables `bb up` injects, verifies connectivity, and waits for your experiment code.

Open `main.go` first. Its header comment maps the lab, `main()` checks the variables and connects each client, and the `new*` wiring functions live below `main()`.

